WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.411
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.444 --> 00:12.446
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.480 --> 00:13.814
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.847 --> 00:15.516
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.549 --> 00:18.719
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.752 --> 00:20.788
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.821 --> 00:22.790
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.823 --> 00:25.293
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.694
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.727 --> 00:29.097
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.130 --> 00:30.364
* SPONGEBOB SQUARE PANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝方形裤子！ *

00:30.398 --> 00:33.134
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.167 --> 00:34.768
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.802 --> 00:36.704
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.737 --> 00:39.707
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.740 --> 00:40.741
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.774 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.411 --> 00:45.713
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.746 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:50.718
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:04.465 --> 01:05.733
( sniffs )
（嗅）

01:05.766 --> 01:07.135
AH...
啊...

01:10.371 --> 01:13.507
( door opens, Pearl crying... )
（门打开，珍珠哭了……）

01:19.713 --> 01:21.215
Krabs:
DON'T CRY, LOVE.
螃蟹：
别哭，爱。

01:21.249 --> 01:23.351
DADDY'S GOING TO MAKE IT
ALL RIGHT.
爸爸会成功的
好吧。

01:23.384 --> 01:24.485
CALM DOWN, GIRL!
冷静点，女孩！

01:24.518 --> 01:28.289
( crying louder )
（哭得更大声）

01:28.322 --> 01:29.457
AH... ( screams )
啊……（尖叫声）

01:39.467 --> 01:42.303
MR. KRABS,
WHAT'S WRONG WITH PEARL?
先生。螃蟹，
珍珠有什么问题吗？

01:42.336 --> 01:44.405
HER SCURVY PROM DATE
STOOD HER UP, BOY
她的坏血病舞会约会
让她站起来，男孩

01:44.438 --> 01:46.574
AND SHE CAN'T SEEM
TO FIND ANOTHER.
她看不到
寻找另一个。

01:46.607 --> 01:50.678
THAT'S BECAUSE THERE'S
ONLY ONE FISH IN THE SEA
那是因为有
海里只有一条鱼

01:50.711 --> 01:55.349
AS LONG, TAN AND HANDSOME
AS HE IS... AND THAT'S HIM!
又长又黑又帅
他就是这样……那就是他！

01:55.383 --> 01:56.750
NO, NO, BABY.
不，不，宝贝。

01:56.784 --> 01:57.918
NO MORE CRYING.
别再哭了。

01:57.951 --> 01:59.320
WE'LL GET YOU A DATE.
我们将为您安排一个约会。

01:59.353 --> 02:01.855
WHY, UH... I'LL TAKE YOU.
为什么，呃……我带你去。

02:01.889 --> 02:05.259
( starting to cry )
（开始哭泣）

02:05.293 --> 02:06.860
WHAT ABOUT SQUIDWARD?
章鱼哥呢？

02:08.329 --> 02:10.531
( starting to cry )
（开始哭泣）

02:10.564 --> 02:12.433
WAIT, WAIT...
等等，等等...

02:12.466 --> 02:14.468
HERE, TAKE SPONGEBOB.
来，拿海绵宝宝。

02:14.502 --> 02:15.469
AH! THE FRY COOK?
啊！油炸厨师？

02:15.503 --> 02:18.539
DO YOU KNOW WHAT THAT WOULD DO
TO MY COMPLEXION?
你知道那会做什么吗
适合我的肤色吗？

02:18.572 --> 02:21.342
PEOPLE WILL MISTAKE ME
FOR A PLANETARIUM.
人们会误解我
对于天文馆来说。

02:21.375 --> 02:22.676
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
你是什​​么意思？

02:22.710 --> 02:25.913
I DON'T KNOW...
BUT I CAN'T TAKE HIM, DADDY.
我不知道...
但我不能带走他，爸爸。

02:25.946 --> 02:31.419
THEY'LL KICK ME OFF
THE MOST FREQUENTLY PICTURED
IN THE YEARBOOK COMMITTEE.
他们会把我踢开
最常出现的照片
在年鉴委员会中。

02:31.452 --> 02:32.586
YEAH, THEY WOULD.
是的，他们会的。

02:32.620 --> 02:34.888
WE'VE GOT TO FIND
SOMEONE ELSE.
我们必须找到
其他人。

02:34.922 --> 02:38.359
LISTEN UP! WHICH ONE
OF YOU LUCKY LUBBERS
WANTS TO TAKE
听着！哪一个
你们这些幸运的笨蛋
想要采取

02:38.392 --> 02:41.862
ME LOVELY DAUGHTER PEARL
TO THE PROM?
我可爱的女儿珍珠
去舞会？

02:46.500 --> 02:49.803
JUST DON'T BE LATE,
SPONGEBOB.
只是不要迟到，
海绵宝宝。

02:49.837 --> 02:53.407
NOW LISTEN, BOY,
I'M A-COUNTING ON YOU
现在听着，男孩，
我指望你

02:53.441 --> 02:55.809
TO MAKE THIS
A VERY SPECIAL NIGHT
为了做到这一点
一个非常特别的夜晚

02:55.843 --> 02:57.611
FOR A VERY SPECIAL GIRL.
献给一个非常特别的女孩。

02:57.645 --> 03:00.548
REMEMBER, YOU'RE DOING
IT FOR GOOD OLD MR...
记住，你正在做
这是为了好老先生...

03:00.581 --> 03:01.949
OH, HI, MR. KRABS.
哦，嗨，先生。螃蟹。

03:01.982 --> 03:04.885
ARE YOU TALKING TO
THAT DUMMY I MADE?
你在说话吗
我做的那个假人？

03:04.918 --> 03:07.555
IT'S PRETTY REALISTIC,
ISN'T IT?
这很现实，
不是吗？

03:07.588 --> 03:09.290
I MADE THIS PART OUT OF...
我用...制作了这部分

03:09.323 --> 03:10.524
NEVER MIND THAT, BOY!
别介意，孩子！

03:10.558 --> 03:12.626
YOU'RE TAKING PEARL
TO HER PROM.
你正在带走珍珠
去她的舞会。

03:12.660 --> 03:13.794
REALLY? OH, WOW!
真的吗？哦，哇！

03:13.827 --> 03:16.530
DON'T WORRY, MR. KRABS.
别担心，先生。螃蟹。

03:16.564 --> 03:18.432
I AM A PROM EXPERT.
我是舞会专家。

03:18.466 --> 03:20.734
OH, GARY,
I'M A PROM FAILURE.
哦，加里，
我在舞会上失败了。

03:20.768 --> 03:24.772
I COULDN'T EVEN GET A DATE
FOR MY OWN JUNIOR PROM.
我什至无法约会
为了我自己的初级舞会。

03:24.805 --> 03:26.407
( meows )
（喵）

03:26.440 --> 03:28.876
NO, THAT WAS PATRICK
WHO BROUGHT HIS MOM.
不，那是帕特里克
谁带来了他的妈妈。

03:28.909 --> 03:31.479
BESIDES, HOW AM I
SUPPOSED TO COMPARE
另外，我怎么样
应该比较

03:31.512 --> 03:32.946
WITH PEARL'S
OLD BOYFRIEND
带珍珠的
老男友

03:32.980 --> 03:34.682
MR. LONG,
TAN AND HANDSOME?
先生。长，
晒黑又帅？

03:34.715 --> 03:36.317
( meows )
（喵）

03:36.350 --> 03:37.485
WHAT IS IT, GARY?
这是什么，加里？

03:37.518 --> 03:38.886
WHAT DO YOU HAVE?
你有什么？

03:38.919 --> 03:40.488
( honking and beeping )
（喇叭声和嘟嘟声）

03:40.521 --> 03:41.522
SAY, GARY...
说吧，加里……

03:41.555 --> 03:44.358
THIS MAGAZINE
GIVES ME AN IDEA.
这本杂志
给了我一个主意。

04:13.354 --> 04:15.022
LONG...
长的...

04:15.055 --> 04:16.590
TAN...
谭...

04:16.624 --> 04:19.427
MMM... HANDSOME.
嗯……很帅。

04:19.460 --> 04:20.528
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

04:20.561 --> 04:22.029
OKAY, GARY,
WAIT TILL PEARL
好的，加里，
等到珍珠

04:22.062 --> 04:23.531
GETS AN EYEFUL
OF THIS!
目光敏锐
这个！

04:28.636 --> 04:31.672
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

04:31.705 --> 04:34.575
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

04:34.608 --> 04:35.943
HELLO?
你好？

04:37.745 --> 04:39.046
WHAT DO YOU THINK, PEARL?
珍珠，你觉得怎么样？

04:39.079 --> 04:41.349
CLEANS UP PRETTY GOOD,
DOESN'T HE?
清理得很好，
他不是吗？

04:41.382 --> 04:43.851
WELL, AT LEAST NO ONE
WILL RECOGNIZE YOU.
好吧，至少没有人
会认出你的。

04:43.884 --> 04:45.619
NOW, LISTEN, SPONGEBOB.
现在，听着，海绵宝宝。

04:45.653 --> 04:47.355
I JUST WANT TO
GET THROUGH THIS
我只想
渡过难关

04:47.388 --> 04:48.856
WITH MY SOCIAL STATUS
INTACT.
我的社会地位
完好无损。

04:48.889 --> 04:51.659
I WANT TO GO TO THE PROM,
GET MY PICTURE TAKEN
我想去参加舞会，
给我拍照

04:51.692 --> 04:53.026
AND I WANT TO DANCE...
我想跳舞...

04:53.060 --> 04:54.027
...DRINK PUNCH...
...喝潘趣酒...

04:54.061 --> 04:55.696
AND DON'T DO
THAT OTHER THING
并且不要这样做
那件事

04:55.729 --> 04:56.530
YOU'RE ALWAYS DOING...
你总是在做...

04:56.564 --> 04:58.632
UH, PEARL, WE GOT TO GET
TO THE LIMO.
呃，珍珠，我们必须得到
到豪华轿车。

04:58.666 --> 04:59.800
A LIMO!
豪华轿车！

04:59.833 --> 05:02.503
WHY DIDN'T YOU SAY SO?
你为什么不这么说？

05:02.536 --> 05:03.771
I LOVE LIMOUSINES!
我喜欢豪华轿车！

05:03.804 --> 05:05.839
GO EASY ON HIM, LASSIE!
放轻松点，莱西！

05:05.873 --> 05:10.978
I CAN'T AFFORD TO BREAK IN
A NEW FRY COOK! HAR-HAR-HAR...
我无法承担闯入的费用
新的油炸厨师！哈哈哈……

05:11.011 --> 05:13.614
( rock music playing )
（摇滚乐演奏）

05:13.647 --> 05:16.617
( metal scraping harshly... )
（金属刮擦声剧烈……）

05:16.650 --> 05:19.453
Crowd:
OW... OW... OW...!
人群：
噢……噢……噢……！

05:19.487 --> 05:21.655
( music continues,
general conversation )
（音乐继续，
一般对话）

05:21.689 --> 05:24.091
THE GYM
LOOKS WONDERFUL.
健身房
看起来棒极了。

05:24.124 --> 05:28.095
WELL, I GUESS
THE FIRST THING
WE SHOULD DO IS...
嗯，我猜
第一件事
我们应该做的是...

05:28.128 --> 05:29.630
( camera clicks )
（相机点击）

05:29.663 --> 05:32.566
YAY, MY FIRST
PROM PICTURE!
是的，我的第一次
舞会照片！

05:32.600 --> 05:35.603
UH... OUR FIRST
PROM PICTURE.
呃...我们的第一次
舞会照片。

05:36.937 --> 05:39.607
LET'S GET THIS OVER WITH.
让我们结束这一切吧。

05:39.640 --> 05:41.041
COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

05:41.074 --> 05:42.743
BE RIGHT THERE!
就在那里！

05:42.776 --> 05:44.144
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

05:44.177 --> 05:46.580
WILL YOU HURRY UP?
你能快点吗？

05:46.614 --> 05:48.749
UH... JUST A SECOND!
呃……等一下！

05:48.782 --> 05:50.083
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

05:50.117 --> 05:51.452
COMING...
未来...

05:51.485 --> 05:52.620
SORRY...
对不起...

05:52.653 --> 05:54.121
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

05:54.154 --> 05:57.558
HERE I AM...!
我在这里...！

05:57.591 --> 06:00.394
CHEESE...! OH!
奶酪...！哦！

06:02.129 --> 06:04.665
THAT WILL BE A KEEPER.
那将是一个守门员。

06:04.698 --> 06:05.999
Girl:
LOOK, IT'S PEARL!
女孩：
看，这是珍珠！

06:06.033 --> 06:07.501
HI, PEARL!
嗨，珍珠！

06:07.535 --> 06:09.537
SPONGEBOB,
HERE COME MY FRIENDS!
海绵宝宝，
我的朋友们来了！

06:09.570 --> 06:10.971
UH... GO GET ME
SOME PUNCH!
呃...去接我吧
来一拳！

06:11.004 --> 06:13.073
PROM EXPERT, AWAY!
舞会专家，走吧！

06:13.106 --> 06:14.508
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

06:14.542 --> 06:16.810
Girls:
HI, PEARL!
女孩：
嗨，珍珠！

06:16.844 --> 06:18.111
HI, GIRLS.
嗨，女孩们。

06:19.212 --> 06:20.981
I'D LIKE YOU TO MEET
BILLY FISHKINS.
我想见见你
比利·菲什金斯。

06:21.014 --> 06:21.982
MEEP.
米普。

06:22.015 --> 06:23.851
AND YOU KNOW
BRIAN FLOUNDER
你知道
布莱恩·比目鱼

06:23.884 --> 06:25.018
FROM MATH CLASS.
来自数学课。

06:25.052 --> 06:26.019
MEEP.
米普。

06:26.053 --> 06:27.555
HI, BRIAN.
嗨，布莱恩。

06:27.588 --> 06:30.624
SO... LIKE, WHERE'S
YOUR DATE, PEARL?
所以...就像，在哪里
你的约会对象，珀尔？

06:30.658 --> 06:32.593
WE'RE DYING
TO MEET HIM.
我们快死了
去见他。

06:32.626 --> 06:36.797
HE'S OVER AT THE PUNCH BOWL
GETTING ME SOME PUNCH.
HE'S OVER AT THE PUNCH BOWL
给我一些打击。

06:36.830 --> 06:39.199
OOH, IS HE
THE REALLY TALL ONE?
哦，是他吗
真的很高吗？

06:39.232 --> 06:40.200
OH, YES.
哦是的。

06:40.233 --> 06:41.669
I MEAN, OH, NO...
我的意思是，哦，不...

06:41.702 --> 06:43.971
AH... EEE...
啊……呃……

06:44.004 --> 06:46.073
EEE...
电子电气设备...

06:46.106 --> 06:48.075
AH... EEE...
啊……呃……

06:48.108 --> 06:51.845
AH... EEE... AH...
啊……呃……啊……

06:51.879 --> 06:53.514
( boinging )
（轰隆声）

06:53.547 --> 06:55.048
HUP-HUP-HUP...
呼呼呼……

06:55.082 --> 06:56.717
HUP-HUP-HUP-HUP...
哈哈哈哈哈哈……

06:56.750 --> 06:58.051
HUP-HUP-HUP...
呼呼呼……

06:58.085 --> 07:00.521
WHOA... OH!
哇...哦！

07:00.554 --> 07:01.955
OH...!
哦...！

07:01.989 --> 07:05.793
OH, QUICK, LET'S GO SEE
HOW UGLY CINDY'S DRESS IS.
哦，快点，我们去看看
辛迪的裙子真丑。

07:05.826 --> 07:08.028
THANK YOU.
MEEP.
谢谢。
米普。

07:08.061 --> 07:10.163
YEAH, THANKS.
是的，谢谢。

07:10.197 --> 07:12.766
SPONGEBOB,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?!
海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

07:12.800 --> 07:14.034
HI, PEARL!
嗨，珍珠！

07:15.035 --> 07:16.770
COME ON, IT WON'T BITE.
来吧，它不会咬人的。

07:16.804 --> 07:19.006
YOU LOOK RIDICULOUS!
你看起来很可笑！

07:19.039 --> 07:20.541
( gasps )
（喘气）

07:20.574 --> 07:21.709
WHAT IS IT?
它是什么？

07:21.742 --> 07:23.977
GET DOWN,
THEY'LL SEE US!
下来，
他们会看到我们！

07:24.011 --> 07:27.515
IT'S MY EX-BOYFRIEND,
OCTAVIUS REX
这是我的前男友，
奥克泰维斯·雷克斯

07:27.548 --> 07:30.584
A.K.A.
LONG, TAN AND HANDSOME.
又名
长、棕褐色、英俊。

07:30.618 --> 07:31.752
MEEP.
米普。

07:31.785 --> 07:34.855
WHOA... BUT I BET
HE ISN'T HOLDER
哇……但我敢打赌
他不是持有者

07:34.888 --> 07:39.192
OF THE REGIONAL ROMANTIC
DANCE CHAMPIONSHIP TROPHY.
地区浪漫主义
舞蹈冠军奖杯。

07:39.226 --> 07:40.894
GIVE ME THAT BACK.
把那个还给我。

07:40.928 --> 07:42.730
( laughs )
THAT DIDN'T JUST HAPPEN.
（笑）
这并不是刚刚发生的。

07:42.763 --> 07:43.997
LET'S GO!
我们走吧！

07:44.031 --> 07:45.966
( rock music playing )
（摇滚乐演奏）

07:45.999 --> 07:47.067
READY?
准备好？

07:50.538 --> 07:52.039
SPONGEBOB,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

07:52.072 --> 07:54.908
CAN'T YOU SEE EVERYBODY HERE
IS DOING THE WHACK?
你看不到这里的每个人吗
正在实施打击吗？

07:55.943 --> 07:57.545
( whacking )
（重击）

07:59.212 --> 08:00.914
THE WHACK?
重击？

08:00.948 --> 08:03.116
OH, YEAH, I INVENTED THAT ONE.
哦，是的，我发明了那个。

08:03.150 --> 08:04.685
UH... ( boinging )
呃……（轰鸣声）

08:04.718 --> 08:06.620
ARE YOU SURE
YOU CAN DO THIS?
你确定吗
你能做到吗？

08:08.756 --> 08:10.223
OH...!
哦...！

08:12.893 --> 08:13.894
( screams )
（尖叫声）

08:16.630 --> 08:21.902
( screaming, crashing,
clattering... )
（尖叫声、崩溃声、
哗啦啦……）

08:21.935 --> 08:25.138
WELL, I GUESS YOU CAN
TAKE ME HOME NOW.
嗯，我想你可以
现在就带我回家吧。

08:25.172 --> 08:29.076
NOW THAT YOU'VE RUINED
EVERYTHING... ( crying )
既然你已经毁了
一切……（哭）

08:29.109 --> 08:31.845
DON'T CRY...
THE PROM EXPERT IS HERE.
别哭...
舞会专家就在这里。

08:31.879 --> 08:33.814
I HAVEN'T FAILED YET...
我还没有失败...

08:33.847 --> 08:37.050
HEY, WE CAN STILL...
NO, I BROKE THAT.
嘿，我们仍然可以...
不，我打破了。

08:37.084 --> 08:39.853
I KNOW! WE COULD... NO.
我知道！我们可以...不。

08:39.887 --> 08:42.055
DON'T CRY, DON'T CRY.
别哭，别哭。

08:42.089 --> 08:45.659
WHATEVER YOU DO,
DON'T...
无论你做什么，
不要...

08:45.693 --> 08:49.597
( crying )
（哭）

08:49.630 --> 08:52.833
WOW, WHAT DID YOU DO
TO HIM?
哇，你做了什么
给他？

08:52.866 --> 08:55.002
POOR LITTLE GUY.
可怜的小家伙。

08:55.035 --> 08:57.671
( crying... )
（哭了……）

08:57.705 --> 09:00.808
( screaming... )
（尖叫……）

09:02.676 --> 09:03.911
SPONGE, ARE YOU OKAY?
海绵，你还好吗？

09:03.944 --> 09:07.581
SpongeBob ( crying ):
OH... RUINED
EVERYTHING. OH...
海绵宝宝（哭）：
哦...毁了
一切。哦...

09:07.615 --> 09:11.084
DON'T WORRY, SPONGEBOB--
YOU DIDN'T MESS EVERYTHING UP.
别担心，海绵宝宝——
你没有把一切搞砸。

09:11.118 --> 09:14.788
( wailing
incoherently ):
...HOT DOG.
（哀嚎
语无伦次）：
...热狗。

09:14.822 --> 09:17.224
( laughs )
ACTUALLY, IT WAS
PRETTY FUNNY
（笑）
事实上，它是
很有趣

09:17.257 --> 09:19.960
WHEN THAT HOT DOG
LANDED IN JUDY'S HAIR.
当那个热狗
落在朱迪的头发上。

09:19.993 --> 09:22.796
( wailing ):
...GOOD TIME.
（哀号）：
...好时光。

09:22.830 --> 09:24.965
BUT I AM HAVING
A GOOD TIME.
但我有
美好时光。

09:24.998 --> 09:28.101
YOU KNOW, WE HAVEN'T
FINISHED OUR DANCE YET.
你知道，我们还没有
我们的舞蹈还没有结束。

09:28.135 --> 09:30.070
( mumbling question )
（咕哝着问）

09:30.103 --> 09:32.706
YES, YOU CAN STILL
WEAR THE WIG.
是的，您仍然可以
戴上假发。

09:32.740 --> 09:33.907
LET'S GO!
我们走吧！

09:37.044 --> 09:39.046
Singer:
ALL RIGHT, YOU INVERTEBRATES.
歌手：
好吧，你们这些无脊椎动物。

09:39.079 --> 09:42.616
I'M GOING TO TEACH YOU
HOW TO DO THE SPONGE.
我来教你
如何做海绵。

09:42.650 --> 09:45.285
* WELL, IF YOU TAKE YOUR LEG
AND YOU STICK IT IN THE AIR *
* 好吧，如果你把你的腿拿开
然后你把它贴在空中*

09:45.318 --> 09:48.622
* AND THEN YOU TAKE THE OTHER
ONE AND JAM IT RIGHT UP THERE *
* 然后你拿另一个
一并把它卡在上面 *

09:48.656 --> 09:51.825
* YOU TWIST YOURSELF AROUND
AND GIVE A GREAT BIG LUNGE *
* 你扭曲自己
并进行大幅度的弓步 *

09:51.859 --> 09:53.961
* NOW YOU'RE DOING THE SPONGE
* 现在你正在做海绵

09:53.994 --> 09:56.764
* HUH, DO THE SPONGE, SPONGE,
OH, DO THE SPONGE *
* 嗯，做海绵，海绵，
哦，做海绵*

09:56.797 --> 10:00.033
* BET YOUR BUNS
YOU'RE DOING THE SPONGE *
* 赌你的面包
你正在做海绵*

10:00.067 --> 10:02.402
* WELL, NOW, FIRST
YOU TAKE YOUR LEG *
* 好吧，现在，首先
你拿走你的腿*

10:02.435 --> 10:05.839
* AND YOU STICK IT IN THE AIR
* 然后你把它贴在空中

10:05.873 --> 10:08.909
* AND THEN YOU TAKE
THE OTHER ONE *
* 然后你就采取
另一个 *

10:08.942 --> 10:10.811
OH, OH, OH...!
* AND YOU JAM IT
RIGHT UP THERE... *
哦，哦，哦……！
* 然后你就卡住了
就在那里... *

10:10.844 --> 10:12.312
MEEP, MEEP.
米普，米普。

10:12.345 --> 10:13.881
GET LOST, PIZZA TOPPING.
迷路，披萨配料。

10:13.914 --> 10:15.849
CAN'T YOU SEE
I'M DOING THE SPONGE?
你看不到吗
我正在做海绵？

10:15.883 --> 10:18.218
* ...A BIG LUNGE
* ...一个大的冲刺

10:18.251 --> 10:21.989
* NOW YOU'RE DOING, YEAH,
NOW YOU'RE DOING THE SPONGE *
* 现在你正在做的，是的，
现在你正在做海绵 *

10:22.022 --> 10:24.692
* ALL RIGHT NOW, YEAH,
DO THE SPONGE, SPONGE *
* 现在好了，是的，
做海绵，海绵*

10:24.725 --> 10:27.661
( screaming... )
* OH, DO THE SPONGE
（尖叫……）
*哦，做海绵

10:27.695 --> 10:29.663
* BEFORE YOU KNOW,
YOU'RE TAKING THE PLUNGE *
* 在你知道之前，
你正在冒险*

10:29.697 --> 10:32.199
* I SAID THE SPONGE, SPONGE,
OH, DO THE SPONGE *
*我说的是海绵，海绵，
哦，做海绵*

10:32.232 --> 10:35.002
( siren wailing... )
* BET YOUR BUNS
YOU'RE DOING THE SPONGE *
（警笛鸣叫……）
* 赌你的面包
你正在做海绵*

10:35.035 --> 10:38.138
* YEAH, BET YOUR BUNS
YOU'RE DOING THE SPONGE *
* 是啊，赌你的面包
你正在做海绵*

10:38.171 --> 10:41.074
* OH, YEAH, WELL,
YOU'RE DOING THE SPONGE *
*哦，是啊，好吧，
你正在做海绵*

10:41.108 --> 10:44.678
* OH, I SAID THE SPONGE, SPONGE,
YEAH, DO THE SPONGE *
*哦，我说的是海绵，海绵，
是的，做海绵 *

10:44.712 --> 10:47.347
( whooping )
* YEAH, DO THE SPONGE,
SPONGE... *
（呼喊）
* 是的，做海绵，
海绵... *

10:47.380 --> 10:49.683
SpongeBob and Pearl:
THEY LOVE US!
海绵宝宝和珍珠：
他们爱我们！

10:49.717 --> 10:53.954
Both:
YAY, WE'RE POPULAR!
两者：
是的，我们很受欢迎！

10:53.987 --> 10:56.790
( crowd grumbling... )
（众人议论纷纷……）

10:58.992 --> 11:01.795
GO WRECK SOMEONE ELSE'S
PROM, WILL YOU?
去破坏别人的
舞会，你愿意吗？

11:05.766 --> 11:07.134
GEE WHIZ, PEARL.
哎呀，珍珠。

11:07.167 --> 11:10.003
I'M SORRY TONIGHT
DIDN'T TURN OUT
LIKE YOU PLANNED.
今晚我很抱歉
没有结果
就像你计划的那样。

11:10.037 --> 11:11.872
OH, DON'T WORRY, SPONGEBOB.
哦，别担心，海绵宝宝。

11:11.905 --> 11:14.441
I KNEW IT WOULD BE
A TOTAL DISASTER ALL ALONG.
我就知道会是这样
一场彻头彻尾的灾难。

11:14.474 --> 11:16.343
BUT AS FAR AS DISASTERS GO
但就灾难而言

11:16.376 --> 11:17.745
THAT WAS REALLY FUN.
那真的很有趣。

11:17.778 --> 11:19.012
Mr. Krabs:
AHA!
蟹老板先生：
啊哈！

11:19.046 --> 11:20.981
KEEP AWAY FROM
MY PRECIOUS FLOWER!
远离
我珍贵的花！

11:21.014 --> 11:21.849
( gasps )
（喘气）

11:21.882 --> 11:23.450
YOU ALMOST STEPPED ON IT.
你差点踩到它了。

11:24.852 --> 11:27.120
OH, DADDY!
哦，爸爸！

11:27.154 --> 11:30.423
WELL, GOODNIGHT,
SHORT, YELLOW AND SPONGY.
好吧，晚安，
短、黄色、海绵状。

11:30.457 --> 11:31.324
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

11:35.062 --> 11:36.797
GOOD JOB, LADDIE.
干得好，小伙子。

11:44.271 --> 11:46.840
OH, THERE YOU ARE, DUMMY.
哦，你来了，笨蛋。

11:46.874 --> 11:48.308
YOU SURE COME IN HANDY.
你一定能派上用场。

11:48.341 --> 11:51.078
( laughing... )
（笑……）

12:05.025 --> 12:07.027
SpongeBob:
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
海绵宝宝：
嘿，章鱼哥。

12:07.060 --> 12:08.361
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，章鱼哥。

12:08.395 --> 12:09.897
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，章鱼哥。

12:09.930 --> 12:11.031
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，章鱼哥。

12:11.064 --> 12:12.365
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，章鱼哥。

12:12.399 --> 12:14.234
OKAY, I'LL BITE.
好吧，我会咬的。

12:14.267 --> 12:16.937
WHAT IS IT,
SPONGEBOB?
它是什么，
海绵宝宝？

12:16.970 --> 12:18.371
DO YOU KNOW WHAT TODAY IS?
你知道今天是什么日子吗？

12:18.405 --> 12:19.940
ANNOY SQUIDWARD DAY?
惹恼了《章鱼哥》日吗？

12:19.973 --> 12:21.141
( SpongeBob laughs )
（海绵宝宝笑了）

12:21.174 --> 12:22.309
NO, SILLY.
不，傻瓜。

12:22.342 --> 12:24.177
THAT'S ON THE 15TH.
那是 15 号。

12:24.211 --> 12:26.847
TODAY'S THE BEGINNING
OF THE JUDGING
今天是开始
评审的

12:26.880 --> 12:28.515
FOR EMPLOYEE OF THE MONTH.
本月最佳员工。

12:28.548 --> 12:32.119
SPONGEBOB, DON'T YOU KNOW
THAT AWARD IS A SCAM?
海绵宝宝，你不知道吗
该奖项是骗局吗？

12:32.152 --> 12:33.520
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
你是什​​么意思？

12:33.553 --> 12:35.555
MR. KRABS GIVES YOU
THAT AWARD
先生。蟹肉给你
那个奖项

12:35.588 --> 12:38.425
SO YOU'LL WORK HARDER
FOR NO EXTRA MONEY.
所以你会更加努力地工作
无需额外付费。

12:38.458 --> 12:40.093
THAT IS NOT TRUE, SQUIDWARD.
这不是真的，章鱼哥。

12:40.127 --> 12:42.162
HE GIVES IT TO ME
BECAUSE I WORK HARDER.
他把它给了我
因为我工作更努力。

12:42.195 --> 12:44.231
YOU COULD WIN IT, TOO,
IF YOU TRIED HARDER.
你也能赢得它，
如果你更努力的话。

12:44.264 --> 12:45.332
OH, FOR WHAT?
哦，为了什么？

12:45.365 --> 12:48.335
TO GET MY FACE
ON THE WALL OF SHAME?
为了得到我的脸
在耻辱之墙上？

12:48.368 --> 12:50.337
SQUIDWARD, YOU'VE GOT IT
ALL WRONG.
章鱼哥，你做到了
都错了。

12:50.370 --> 12:53.473
HAVING PRIDE IN YOUR WORK
IS NOTHING TO BE ASHAMED OF.
对自己的工作感到自豪
没有什么可羞耻的。

12:53.506 --> 12:56.844
WHY, IT'S THE ONLY THING
THAT MAKES IT ALL WORTHWHILE.
为什么，这是唯一的事情
这让一切都变得值得。

12:56.877 --> 12:58.011
THATTABOY, SPONGEBOB.
那个小男孩，海绵宝宝。

12:58.045 --> 13:00.814
THIS IS GOING TO BE
A TOUGH ONE, THOUGH.
这将会是
不过，这是一项艰难的任务。

13:00.848 --> 13:02.916
THERE'S NO
CLEAR-CUT WINNER.
没有
明显的赢家。

13:02.950 --> 13:04.317
WATCH OUT, SPONGEBOB--
小心，海绵宝宝——

13:04.351 --> 13:07.988
SQUIDWARD APPEARS
TO BE ON THE VERGE
OF A BREAKOUT.
章鱼哥出现
处于边缘
突破。

13:08.021 --> 13:10.958
THERE MIGHT BE A NEW FACE
ON THE WALL THIS MONTH.
可能会有新面孔
本月上墙。

13:10.991 --> 13:12.425
HUH?
嗯？

13:14.261 --> 13:16.830
THAT'S RIGHT,
SPONGEBOB.
没错，
海绵宝宝。

13:16.864 --> 13:19.399
I MIGHT SNEAK UP
ON YOU.
我可能会偷偷摸摸
在你身上。

13:19.432 --> 13:22.936
( laughing )
( laughing )
（笑）
（笑）

13:24.404 --> 13:27.007
( laughing )
（笑）

13:27.040 --> 13:28.475
NO!
不！

13:28.508 --> 13:31.278
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

13:31.311 --> 13:35.582
HOW COULD I HAVE LET THE QUALITY
OF MY WORK SLIP SO MUCH?
我怎么能让质量
我的工作单有这么多吗？

13:35.615 --> 13:39.352
( laughing )
（笑）

13:47.227 --> 13:48.428
( grunting )
（咕哝）

13:49.262 --> 13:50.363
( screams )
（尖叫声）

13:52.232 --> 13:54.134
( grunting )
（咕哝）

13:54.167 --> 13:55.903
Squidward:
NEED SOME HELP?
章鱼哥：
需要帮助吗？

13:55.936 --> 13:56.970
( screams )
（尖叫声）

13:57.004 --> 13:59.172
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
你在干什么？

13:59.206 --> 14:01.574
MAKING KRABBY PATTIES?
制作蟹肉饼？

14:01.608 --> 14:03.010
YOU'RE LOSING IT.
你正在失去它。

14:03.043 --> 14:05.478
DON'T YOU KNOW THAT AWARD
IS A LOAD OF...
你不知道这个奖项吗
是一大堆...

14:07.214 --> 14:08.615
GARBAGE.
垃圾。

14:08.648 --> 14:11.118
PLEASE, DON'T TELL
MR. KRABS ABOUT THIS.
请不要告诉
先生。螃蟹关于这个。

14:11.151 --> 14:13.420
IT'LL HURT MY CHANCES
OF WINNING THE AWARD.
这会损害我的机会
获奖。

14:13.453 --> 14:17.991
I ALREADY TOLD YOU,
THAT AWARD IS A BUNCH OF...
我已经告诉过你了，
该奖项是一堆......

14:18.025 --> 14:19.326
BALONEY.
胡扯。

14:19.359 --> 14:21.261
THAT IS NOT TRUE,
SQUIDWARD.
这不是真的，
章鱼哥。

14:21.294 --> 14:24.264
LIKE THIS HAT, THE AWARD
IS A SYMBOL OF...
就像这顶帽子，这个奖项
是...的象征

14:24.297 --> 14:26.299
IT'S A SYMBOL
THAT YOU'RE A CHUMP.
这是一个象征
你是个笨蛋。

14:26.333 --> 14:29.036
( screams )
NO, SQUIDWARD. OH!
（尖叫声）
不，章鱼哥。哦！

14:29.069 --> 14:31.438
AND THIS IS A SYMBOL
OF WHAT I THINK
这是一个象征
我的想法

14:31.471 --> 14:34.407
OF THE EMPLOYEE
OF THE MONTH AWARD!
员工的
本月最佳奖！

14:34.441 --> 14:35.675
( clang )
OW!
（叮当）
噢！

14:35.708 --> 14:38.178
AN EXPERIENCED
EMPLOYEE OF THE MONTH
经验丰富
本月最佳员工

14:38.211 --> 14:40.547
ALWAYS KEEPS A BRICK OF LEAD
IN HIS HAT.
永远保留一块铅
戴着帽子。

14:40.580 --> 14:43.150
I'M TELLING YOU
FOR THE LAST TIME
我告诉你
最后一次

14:43.183 --> 14:45.618
THAT AWARD IS
NOTHING BUT A JOKE.
该奖项是
只不过是个笑话。

14:48.621 --> 14:50.423
WHAT IF SQUIDWARD'S RIGHT?
如果章鱼哥是对的怎么办？

14:50.457 --> 14:52.292
WHAT IF THE AWARD IS A PHONY?
如果该奖项是假的怎么办？

14:52.325 --> 14:55.462
DOES THIS MEAN MY WHOLE BODY
OF WORK IS MEANINGLESS?
这是否意味着我的整个身体
工作毫无意义？

14:55.495 --> 14:57.464
STOW THAT KIND OF TALK, SAILOR.
收起这种谈话吧，水手。

14:57.497 --> 14:58.966
THIS IS WAR NOW, PRIVATE.
现在是战争，私人的。

14:58.999 --> 15:01.301
THAT'S EXACTLY
WHAT HE WANTS YOU TO THINK.
正是如此
他希望你怎么想。

15:01.334 --> 15:03.536
THIS IS NO TIME TO GO
LILY-LIVERED ON US.
现在不是离开的时候
莉莉——活在我们身上。

15:03.570 --> 15:05.105
BUT, SIR...
但是，先生……

15:05.138 --> 15:07.340
THERE'S NO ROOM FOR
"BUTS" IN WAR, SOLDIER.
没有空间了
“但是”在战争中，士兵。

15:07.374 --> 15:08.976
HE WANTS YOU TO CRACK.
他希望你崩溃。

15:09.009 --> 15:11.411
HE'S TRYING TO TRICK YOU,
GET INSIDE YOUR MIND.
他想欺骗你，
深入你的内心。

15:11.444 --> 15:15.082
YOU MUST STOP AT NOTHING--
AND I MEAN NOTHING--
TO DEFEAT HIM.
你必须不择手段——
我没什么意思——
打败他。

15:15.115 --> 15:17.017
HAVE I MADE MYSELF CLEAR,
PRIVATE?
我已经说清楚了吗？
私人的？

15:17.050 --> 15:18.318
CRYSTAL, SIR.
水晶，先生。

15:18.351 --> 15:20.387
GOOD. NOW MOVE OUT!
好的。现在搬出去！

15:29.262 --> 15:31.631
I WON'T LET SQUIDWARD WIN.
我不会让章鱼哥赢。

15:36.303 --> 15:40.040
HE CAN'T GO TO WORK
IF HE DOESN'T WAKE UP.
他不能去上班
如果他没有醒来。

15:40.073 --> 15:42.275
TARGET SIGHTED.
瞄准目标。

15:51.151 --> 15:52.185
HUH?
嗯？

16:04.097 --> 16:05.598
( Squidward gargling )
（章鱼哥漱口）

16:21.448 --> 16:22.749
HUH?
嗯？

16:22.782 --> 16:24.117
( muttering )
（嘀咕）

16:26.553 --> 16:27.720
( giggles )
（咯咯笑）

16:36.463 --> 16:38.731
( screaming )
（尖叫）

16:42.335 --> 16:44.271
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

16:44.304 --> 16:45.405
WHAT ARE YOU
DOING HERE?
你是什么？
在这里做什么？

16:45.438 --> 16:49.076
YOU CAN'T WIN THAT AWARD
IF YOU DON'T GET UP FOR WORK.
你无法赢得那个奖项
如果您不起床上班。

16:51.211 --> 16:52.345
HUH?
嗯？

16:52.379 --> 16:54.247
HA-HA.
哈哈。

16:57.317 --> 16:59.719
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

17:03.390 --> 17:06.193
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

17:06.226 --> 17:07.294
STOP IT, SPONGEBOB.
停下来，海绵宝宝。

17:07.327 --> 17:09.296
IF I REALLY WANTED
THAT AWARD
如果我真的想要
那个奖项

17:09.329 --> 17:11.498
I COULD WIN IT
WITH MY TENTACLES TIED.
我能赢
我的触手被绑住了。

17:11.531 --> 17:13.166
THAT CAN BE ARRANGED.
这是可以安排的。

17:13.200 --> 17:15.568
YOU'RE A LUNATIC,
SPONGEBOB!
你是个疯子，
海绵宝宝！

17:15.602 --> 17:20.073
MAYBE SO, BUT I DID WIN EMPLOYEE
OF THE MONTH 26 MONTHS IN A ROW.
也许是这样，但我确实赢得了员工
连续 26 个月当选本月最佳。

17:20.107 --> 17:23.610
ARE Y... ARE YOU TRYING TO SAY
THAT YOU ARE BETTER THAN ME?
你……你想说什么吗？
你比我好吗？

17:23.643 --> 17:28.115
I'VE BEEN BETTER
THAN YOU FOR 26 MONTHS--
AND IT'LL BE 27 TOMORROW.
我已经好多了
26 个月以来一直比你好——
明天就是 27 号了。

17:28.148 --> 17:31.251
OH, THAT'S IT,
SQUARE-FOR-BRAINS,
THAT'S IT!
哦，就是这样，
大脑方格，
就是这样！

17:31.284 --> 17:32.452
I'M GOING
TO SHOW YOU
我要去
向您展示

17:32.485 --> 17:34.687
HOW EASY IT IS TO WIN
THAT AWARD.
获胜是多么容易
那个奖项。

17:34.721 --> 17:37.824
I'M GOING TO BE THE NEW
EMPLOYEE OF THE MONTH.
我要成为新人
本月最佳员工。

17:37.857 --> 17:41.461
I WILL PROVE TO YOU I AM
FAR MORE COMPETENT THAN YOU.
我会向你证明我是
比你更有能力。

17:41.494 --> 17:44.864
WELL, I'M GOING IN EARLY
TO WAX THE FLOORS.
好吧，我要早点去
给地板打蜡。

17:44.897 --> 17:47.734
I'LL HAVE DONE IT BY
THE TIME YOU GET THERE.
我会做到的
您到达那里的时间。

17:47.767 --> 17:50.637
YOU'LL HAVE TO GET UP
EARLY TO GET THERE BEFORE ME.
你必须起床
在我之前早点到达那里。

17:50.670 --> 17:53.406
I DON'T NEED THE SLEEP... LOSER.
我不需要睡眠……失败者。

17:53.440 --> 17:56.443
WELL, ME NEITHER...
26-TIME LOSER.
嗯，我也不……
26次失败者。

18:01.548 --> 18:05.118
LOOK AT HIM,
WATCHING ME.
看看他，
看着我。

18:05.152 --> 18:07.854
I'M WATCHING YOU, SPONGEBOB.
我在看着你，海绵宝宝。

18:07.887 --> 18:11.124
YOU'RE NOT LEAVING BEFORE ME.
你不会在我之前离开。

18:11.158 --> 18:14.761
HEY, SQUIDWARD,
GETTING SLEEPY, HUH?
嘿，章鱼哥，
困了，是吧？

18:14.794 --> 18:17.597
NO. HOW ABOUT YOU?
不。你呢？

18:17.630 --> 18:18.698
NOPE.
没有。

18:18.731 --> 18:21.868
( playing lullaby...)
（播放摇篮曲...）

18:27.940 --> 18:29.809
NIGHTY-NIGHT.
晚安。

18:31.911 --> 18:36.849
( snoring )
（打鼾）

18:38.585 --> 18:39.652
( chuckling )
（咯咯笑）

18:39.686 --> 18:40.753
( screams )
（尖叫声）

18:42.622 --> 18:43.923
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

18:43.956 --> 18:45.458
HEY, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，章鱼哥。

18:45.492 --> 18:47.327
GOING SOMEWHERE?
要去某个地方？

18:47.360 --> 18:50.530
I'M GOING TO WRING YOU DRY
WHEN I GET OUT OF HERE.
我要把你拧干
当我离开这里时。

18:50.563 --> 18:52.432
NOW, GET ME OUT OF HERE.
现在，带我离开这里。

18:52.465 --> 18:53.566
OKAY, SQUIDWARD.
好的，章鱼哥。

18:53.600 --> 18:55.302
I'LL STOP BY AFTER WORK.
下班后我会过来。

18:55.335 --> 18:57.370
SPONGEBOB...!
海绵宝宝...！

18:57.404 --> 18:58.571
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

18:58.605 --> 19:00.240
NOW TO GET SOME REST.
现在休息一下。

19:00.273 --> 19:04.911
DON'T WANT TO LOOK TIRED FOR
MY EMPLOYEE OF THE MONTH PHOTO.
不想看起来很累
我的本月员工照片。

19:04.944 --> 19:07.947
( snoring... )
（打呼噜……）

19:07.980 --> 19:10.450
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

19:13.620 --> 19:15.355
( hammering )
（锤击）

19:15.388 --> 19:16.356
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

19:17.824 --> 19:20.193
THAT OUGHT TO HOLD HIM.
这应该能阻止他。

19:20.227 --> 19:21.561
( sawing )
（锯切）

19:24.364 --> 19:25.765
( laughs )
（笑）

19:29.669 --> 19:31.338
( chuckling )
（咯咯笑）

19:31.371 --> 19:32.705
HUH?
嗯？

19:32.739 --> 19:34.441
OH...
哦...

19:34.474 --> 19:35.608
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

19:35.642 --> 19:37.310
WHY, YOU LITTLE...
为什么，你这个小...

19:41.914 --> 19:42.815
OH...
哦...

19:42.849 --> 19:45.218
( laughing )
（笑）

19:45.252 --> 19:47.254
HMM... A KRABBY PATTY.
嗯……蟹肉饼。

19:47.287 --> 19:47.887
( sniffing )
（嗅）

19:49.456 --> 19:50.957
OW!
噢！

19:50.990 --> 19:52.659
( stifled ):
SQUIDWARD!
（窒息）：
章鱼哥！

19:52.692 --> 19:53.960
SO LONG, SPONGE LOSER.
再见，海绵失败者。

19:53.993 --> 19:54.961
( yells )
（大喊）

19:54.994 --> 19:56.263
( laughs )
（笑）

20:00.833 --> 20:01.934
( Squidward laughs )
（章鱼哥大笑）

20:01.968 --> 20:03.636
( SpongeBob laughs )
（海绵宝宝笑了）

20:03.670 --> 20:06.306
( Squidward laughs )
（章鱼哥大笑）

20:06.339 --> 20:09.876
( both grunting
and straining... )
（两人都咕哝着
并用力...）

20:23.022 --> 20:27.727
SPONGEBOB... TRUCE.
海绵宝宝……休战。

20:27.760 --> 20:28.928
TRUCE.
休战。

20:28.961 --> 20:31.498
SPONGEBOB,
I CAN'T TAKE IT ANYMORE.
海绵宝宝，
我再也受不了了。

20:31.531 --> 20:35.001
IF WE KEEP THIS UP, NEITHER
OF US WILL WIN THE AWARD.
如果我们继续这样下去，两者都不会
我们将赢得该奖项。

20:35.034 --> 20:36.403
YOU'RE RIGHT.
你说得对。

20:36.436 --> 20:39.005
WE SHOULD SAVE
OUR ENERGY FOR WORK
我们应该保存
我们的工作能量

20:39.038 --> 20:41.274
WHERE WE REALLY NEED IT.
我们真正需要它的地方。

20:41.308 --> 20:45.011
OKAY, LET'S HAVE
A GOOD, CLEAN FIGHT.
好的，我们开始吧
一场干净利落的战斗。

20:45.044 --> 20:47.980
AND MAY
THE BETTER MAN WIN.
和五月
更好的人获胜。

20:48.014 --> 20:53.286
( thinking ):
HE'S NOTHING BUT A LYING,
BONELESS, INK-SQUIRTING,
BIG-NOSED PHONY.
（思考）：
他只不过是个谎言，
无骨、喷墨、
大鼻子骗子。

20:53.320 --> 20:56.289
LOOK AT THAT BUCK-TOOTHED,
CORN-FED SMILE.
LOOK AT THAT BUCK-TOOTHED,
玉米喂养的微笑。

20:56.323 --> 20:59.759
YOU CAN'T TRUST HIM
AS FAR AS YOU CAN THROW HIM.
你不能相信他
你能把他扔多远就多远。

20:59.792 --> 21:02.662
AS SOON AS HE STOPS
SHAKING MY HAND...
他一停下来
握我的手...

21:02.695 --> 21:05.264
I'M GOING TO MAKE A RUN FOR IT.
我要全力以赴。

21:09.035 --> 21:11.671
( both laugh nervously )
（两人都紧张地笑）

21:11.704 --> 21:15.375
( gasping and panting )
（气喘吁吁）

21:15.408 --> 21:19.379
* MONEY, MONEY,
GOING TO MAKE SOME MONEY... *
* 钱，钱，
要去赚一些钱... *

21:19.412 --> 21:20.947
( squishing
and squirting )
（压扁
和喷）

21:20.980 --> 21:23.616
( gasping and panting )
（气喘吁吁）

21:23.650 --> 21:27.887
AH, IT WARMS ME WALLET TO SEE ME
EMPLOYEES COMING IN SO EARLY.
啊，看到我钱包就暖暖的
员工来得这么早。

21:27.920 --> 21:28.988
( gasping and panting )
（气喘吁吁）

21:29.021 --> 21:31.591
BOYS, YOU'RE EARLY.
孩子们，你们来早了。

21:31.624 --> 21:33.526
( gasping and panting )
（气喘吁吁）

21:33.560 --> 21:35.328
WAIT...!
等待...！

21:35.362 --> 21:38.931
( crashing and clattering )
（碰撞声和咔哒声）

21:38.965 --> 21:41.000
LOOK, MR. KRABS, CLEAN FLOORS!
看，先生。螃蟹，干净的地板！

21:41.033 --> 21:43.836
CLEAN TABLES, MR. KRABS!
干净的桌子，先生。螃蟹！

21:46.005 --> 21:47.607
CLEAN DISHES, MR. KRABS!
干净的盘子，先生。螃蟹！

21:49.509 --> 21:50.710
WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
这是怎么回事？

21:50.743 --> 21:51.978
IT'S MORE EFFICIENT
更高效

21:52.011 --> 21:54.381
TO CLEAN DISHES
THIS WAY, MR. KRABS.
清洁餐具
这边走，先生。螃蟹。

21:54.414 --> 21:55.948
NO!
不！

21:55.982 --> 21:59.452
FLOWERS AND CHOCOLATES
FOR YOU, MR. KRABS!
鲜花和巧克力
为了您，先生。螃蟹！

21:59.486 --> 22:02.922
LOOK, I'M PUTTING MY OWN MONEY
INTO THE REGISTER, MR. KRABS!
看，我正在投入自己的钱
进入登记册，先生。螃蟹！

22:02.955 --> 22:07.460
TWO SPATULAS TO INCREASE
PRODUCTIVITY, MR. KRABS!
两把抹刀增加
生产力，先生。螃蟹！

22:07.494 --> 22:09.662
FASTER, SPONGEBOB, FASTER.
更快，海绵宝宝，更快。

22:09.696 --> 22:12.532
THERE'S NOTHING TO THIS
PATTY FLIPPING, MR. KRABS.
这没什么
帕蒂·弗利平先生螃蟹。

22:12.565 --> 22:16.002
I'LL EASILY DOUBLE YOUR OUTPUT,
SPONGE HOG!
我会轻松地将你的输出加倍，
海绵猪！

22:16.035 --> 22:18.505
BOYS, BOYS, BOYS!
孩子们，孩子们，孩子们！

22:20.072 --> 22:21.741
WHA... HELP!
哇...救命！

22:21.774 --> 22:23.410
HELP!
帮助！

22:35.888 --> 22:38.691
HEY, FREE KRABBY PATTIES!
嘿，免费蟹肉饼！

22:38.725 --> 22:40.693
HEY, LOOK AT THAT,
KRABBY PATTIES!
嘿，看看那个，
蟹肉饼！

22:40.727 --> 22:42.929
Krabs:
WAIT, YOU'VE GOT TO
PAY FOR THOSE.
螃蟹：
等等，你必须
为这些付费。

22:42.962 --> 22:44.831
WAIT! WAIT! WAIT!
等待！等待！等待！

22:44.864 --> 22:47.133
BOYS, THE KRABBY PATTIES!
孩子们，蟹肉饼！

22:47.166 --> 22:50.803
SO, WHO'S THE WINNER
OF EMPLOYEE OF THE MONTH?
ME, ME, ME...!
那么，谁是赢家
本月最佳员工？
我，我，我……！

22:50.837 --> 22:51.971
ME, ME, ME...!
我，我，我……！

22:52.004 --> 22:54.006
WAIT! BOYS,
THE KRABBY PATTIES!
等待！男孩们，
蟹肉饼！

22:54.040 --> 22:56.776
BOYS, WAIT...!
孩子们，等等……！

22:56.809 --> 22:59.579
